{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">天后驚現神奇「雨界」奇觀！網絡近日瘋傳一段影片，有目擊者於天后電氣道直擊異象，並將影片分享至網絡，發文指：「天后電氣道 得前面半條街有雨」。 </p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">片中所見，電氣道前段正下着大雨，雨勢相當猛烈，然而當鏡頭一轉掃向街尾時，當地卻完全乾爽，連一滴雨也沒有，呈現極具視覺衝擊的對比。 </p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-05-12h47m12s828.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026lib2q9tuBL1791176005.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-05-12h47m12s828.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-05-12h47m20s951.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026qILWgWwEYA1791176012.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-05-12h47m20s951.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">片段引發大批網民圍觀熱議，紛紛被這難得一見的畫面震撼：</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">·       <strong>驚嘆抽水派</strong>：不少網民直呼難得一見，笑言：「局部街道性驟雨」、「好難遇到咁樣」，甚至打趣問道：「入咗結界？」 </p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">·       <strong>經驗見證派</strong>：亦有熟路網民指出此類現象在當地並非首次，留言稱：「經常都有，我係天後遇過幾次」。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-05T05:18:51.131501+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":270,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}